From e866fbd233a2b2876d36d4d6dc17b534f2a4eae9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: harshanandak <harshanandak@users.noreply.github.com>
Date: Sun, 28 Jun 2026 23:57:35 +0530
Subject: [PATCH] fix(quick-match): reserve a stable slot for the
 live-broadcast bar (#106)

The LiveBroadcastBar sat directly between the topbar and the score and had wildly
varying height (null while auth resolves -> a control row once ready), so the score
jumped on hydration (CLS). Wrap it in a fixed min-height `.mono-live-slot` in all
three scorer branches so the score holds position. The wrapper is gated on
cloudAuthAvailable so offline builds (bar always null) don't reserve a permanent
empty gap.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 4.8 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
